 a space colony.\n\n• Win through economic and cultural domination, or stunning futuristic warfare.\n\n• Friendly tutorial and on-screen help for fastest entry in the game\n\n• Choose human or one of the 6 alien races, each with unique strengths, weaknesses and special abilities. See and hear alien commanders in high resolution, 3-D rendered,lip-synced animations.\n\n• Overhead 3-D planet map \"zooms in\" to show individual buildings, vehicles, and inhabitants in extraordinary detail.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328440/header.jpg?t=1689355485"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328440/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1689355485"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328440/ss_17d2494a7c14806e6b6809ac7b242bb8990bf1e3.600x338.jpg?t=1689355485","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328440/ss_17d2494a7c14806e6b6809ac7b242bb8990bf1e3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1689355485"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328440/ss_0eb1a8a60222680d5ae6ab584c8a0b2d06f3b286.600x338.jpg?t=1689355485","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328440/ss_0eb1a8a60222680d5ae6ab584c8a0b2d06f3b286.1920x1080.jpg?t=1689355485"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328440/ss_0b363d0d54e5f19b5605b6ace61cb6f7ec74934b.600x338.jpg?t=1689355485","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328440/ss_0b363d0d54e5f19b5605b6ace61cb6f7ec74934b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1689355485"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328440/ss_47235a750